<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-048" chapter-id="c-songshu-048-zhu-succession" source-id="s-songshu-048-zhu-succession-ws1791560">
  <p id="c-songshu-048-zhu-succession:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">虜執<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhu-succession:p001:m0002" ref="wip_vh5_2zm_A">齡石</persName>及敬先還長安，見殺，時年四十。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-048-zhu-succession:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhu-succession:p002:m0001" ref="wip_vh5_2zm_AA">景符</persName>嗣。<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhu-succession:p002:m0005" ref="wip_vh5_2zm_AA">景符</persName>卒，子<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhu-succession:p002:m0010" ref="wip_vh5_2zm_AAA">祖宣</persName>嗣，坐輒之封，八年不反，及不分姑國秩，奪爵。更以<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhu-succession:p002:m0036" ref="wip_vh5_2zm_AAA">祖宣</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhu-succession:p002:m0039" ref="wip_vh5_2zm_AAB">隆</persName>紹封。齊受禪，國除。</p>
</text>
